# Keep local secrets, virtualenvs and runtime state out of every image.
# Audit finding P0-2: without this file COPY . /app ships .env, signing keys
# and var/ into the image, and makes the build context hundreds of MB.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.venv/
.git/
.gitignore
var/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
node_modules/
frontend/dist/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
*.key
*.pem
*.log
*.partial
